# Password Strength Checker 🔐

A simple Python CLI project that checks password strength and provides
detailed feedback and suggestions to improve weak passwords.

## Features
- Check password strength (WEAK / MEDIUM / STRONG)
- Detailed password analysis:
  - Length
  - Uppercase letters
  - Lowercase letters
  - Numbers
  - Special symbols
- Suggestions to improve weak passwords
- Generate a strong random password
- Menu-based command line interface

## Technologies Used
- Python 3

## How to Run
```bash
python proff_pass_check.py

